OL,3,CHundreds line the streets of Surrey
OL,4,Cvillage for funeral of Dame Penelope
OL,5,CKeith
OL,7,FHundreds of people lined the streets
OL,8,Fof a Surrey village for the funeral of
OL,9,FDame Penelope Keith.
OL,11,FLocals turned out in Milford near
OL,12,FGodalming, to pay their respects as
OL,13,Fthe cortege passed through the village
OL,14,Fwhere the actress lived for many years.
OL,16,FShe supported many local charities and
OL,17,Fplayed an active part in village life.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
