OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785250098
OL,3,CHundreds line the streets of Surrey
OL,4,Cvillage for funeral of Dame Penelope
OL,5,CKeith
OL,7,FDame Penelope, who become a household
OL,8,Fname in To the Manor Born, and The
OL,9,FGood Life, on XXX June last month at
OL,10,Fthe age of 86.
OL,12,FPosting a statement at the time, her
OL,13,Ffamily said: "We are deeply saddened
OL,14,Fto announce that Dame Penelope Keith
OL,15,Fdied peacefully whilst living with
OL,16,Fcancer at her home in Surrey where she
OL,17,Fhad lived for more than 50 years.
OL,26,@uD@NOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
