PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785250098
OL,3,CHundreds line the streets of Surrey
OL,4,Cvillage for funeral of Dame Penelope
OL,5,CKeith
OL,7,F"The family is grateful for the care
OL,8,Fand support she received throughout
OL,9,Fher treatments, and ask that their
OL,10,Fprivacy be respected at this time."
OL,12,FPosting a tribute to Dame Penelope, a
OL,13,Fspokesperson for Brooklands Museum
OL,14,Fsaid: "Today, as family, friends and
OL,15,Floved ones gather to say farewell to
OL,16,FDame Penelope Keith, we remember with
OL,17,Fgratitude a remarkable and kind woman
OL,18,Fwho gave so much to Brooklands Museum.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@cO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
