PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785250098
OL,3,CHundreds line the streets of Surrey
OL,4,Cvillage for funeral of Dame Penelope
OL,5,CKeith
OL,7,F"A Trustee of the Museum from 2009 to
OL,8,F2018, Dame Penelope was a passionate
OL,9,Fchampion of Britain's heritage,
OL,10,Fbringing warmth, wisdom and generosity
OL,11,Fto everything she did.
OL,13,F"She played an important role in the
OL,14,FMuseum's journey and was a much-loved
OL,15,Fpresence at many of our most
OL,16,Fsignificant moments.
OL,18,F"Our thoughts are with Dame Penelope's
OL,19,Ffamily and friends today.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
